  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN214.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">pācaṟaikkaṭ ṭalaimakaṉ ṟaṉṉeñciṟkuc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What HE said to his heart in the war camp.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN214.1">
        <l>akaliru vicumpakam putaiyap pāayp</l>
        <l>pakaluṭaṉ karanta palkatir vāṉa</l>
        <l>miruṅkaḷiṟ ṟiṉanirai kuḷirppa vīcip</l>
        <l>perumpeya la<supplied>ḻi</supplied>tuḷi poḻita lāṉātu</l>
        <l>vēntaṉum vempakai muraṇi yēntilai</l>
        <l>viṭukatir neṭuvē limaikkum pācaṟai</l>
        <l>yaṭupukaḻ mēvaloṭu kaṇpaṭai yilaṉē</l>
        <l>yamaru namvayi ṉatuvē namareṉ</l>
        <l>ṉammaṟivu teḷitta pomma lōti</l>
        <l>yāṅkā kuvaḷko ṟāṉē yōṅkuviṭaip</l>
        <l>paṭucuva<supplied>ṟ</supplied> koṇṭa pakuvāyt teṇmaṇi</l>
        <l>yāpeyar kōvala rāmpalō ṭaḷaiip</l>
        <l>paiyu ṇalyāḻ cevvaḻi vakuppa</l>
        <l>vāruyi raṇaṅkun teḷḷicai</l>
        <l>māri mālaiyun tamiyaḷ kēṭṭē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="4">The flow of dwindling droplets from the great rain does not end,</l>
        <l corresp="3">pouring coolly from herds  of dark bull elephants</l>
        <l corresp="2">in the many-rayed  sky that is hidden along with the day,</l>
        <l corresp="1">spread for the wide dark vault of heaven to be covered,</l>
        <l>and the king, in [his] wish for murderous fame, does not close [his] eyes,</l>
        <l>in the encampment winking with ray-emitting long spears</l>
        <l corresp="5-7">with eminent leaf [tips], having encountered hot enmity.</l>
        <l corresp="9d-10c">How will she be, [she with] thick hair,</l>
        <l corresp="9a-c">to whom our understanding has been made clear:</l>
        <l corresp="8">“[these are] our people. That [means] war too is upon us.”</l>
        <l corresp="15">– hearing alone all evening the showers</l>
        <l corresp="14">of clear sound that torment [her] precious life,</l>
        <l corresp="13">when the sorrowful good lute is assigned to a Cevvaḻi [melody],</l>
        <l corresp="12">mingling with the lily [flute] of the cowherds coming back from the cows,</l>
        <l corresp="10d-11">[and] the gaping clear bells worn on the moving napes of tall bulls?</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="alternate" sameAs="13 14b">
        <l>hearing alone all through the rainy evening</l>
        <l>the clear sound that torments [her] precious life</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

